# (thousands of cells each, above the macro placer's 1 000-cell cluster
# floor), on a 1.2 mm die, so wire costs hundreds of ps and the macro
# placer can tell the owners apart. Geometry is the small rung's, scaled.
# Without carried patch 0136 the macro placer stopped on MPL-0005 on
